WEBVTT

00:00:21.927 --> 00:00:23.557
<v><b>A:</b></v> Izzy’s working from home today.

00:00:24.734 --> 00:00:28.286
<v><b>B:</b></v> On a Saturday? What a surprise!

00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:40.641
<v><b>A:</b></v> How are things with you?

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:43.474
<v><b>B:</b></v> Izzy’s doing really well at the new job.

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:56.067
<v><b>A:</b></v> What time are you finishing?

00:00:56.771 --> 00:01:00.469
<v><b>B:</b></v> Well, hopefully about six.

00:01:12.026 --> 00:01:13.370
<v><b>A:</b></v> That sounds really nice.

00:01:13.854 --> 00:01:16.161
<v><b>B:</b></v> Awesome. Let’s say seven?

00:01:27.724 --> 00:01:29.813
<v><b>A:</b></v> Perfect. See you then.

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:32.844
<v><b>B:</b></v> Great, can’t wait.

00:01:44.203 --> 00:01:46.599
<v><b>A:</b></v> You don’t need to worry about me.

00:01:46.901 --> 00:01:48.240
<v><b>B:</b></v> Of course I do!